# condor_submit_dag sweep.dag :
#   1. the grids once per T_sp (build_grids.sub)
#   2. one job per line of parameters_2.txt: identification, light curve, RV, FWHM, BIS, CCF, MAD / RMS (run_10_opt_rv.sub)
#   3. table of all the sets and the figures (collect_stats.sub; it runs even if some sets failed)
JOB grids   build_grids.sub
JOB sets    run_10_opt_rv.sub
JOB collect collect_stats.sub
PARENT grids CHILD sets
PARENT sets  CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST sets /bin/true
